WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:07.834
"Where is he?" Beauty paced around the cottage.

2
00:00:07.835 --> 00:00:11.386
Father should be back by now.

3
00:00:11.387 --> 00:00:15.369
She tried to keep busy in her garden.

4
00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:21.111
"I'm glad the ship arrived," she thought.

5
00:00:21.112 --> 00:00:24.478
"But I wish we could keep living here.

6
00:00:24.479 --> 00:00:29.294
I like this simple life."

7
00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:35.791
One morning Beauty woke early.

8
00:00:35.792 --> 00:00:40.115
"He'll come home today," she thought.

9
00:00:40.116 --> 00:00:44.740
"I know! I'll make a feast for him."

10
00:00:44.741 --> 00:00:49.110
Beauty ground flour from some wheat.

11
00:00:49.111 --> 00:00:52.327
Then she baked some bread.

12
00:00:52.328 --> 00:00:56.365
Next Beauty gathered vegetables.

13
00:00:56.366 --> 00:01:04.647
She cooked all day long.

14
00:01:04.648 --> 00:01:09.187
When the food was ready, she set the table.

15
00:01:09.188 --> 00:01:14.196
"He'll be here any minute!" Beauty thought happily.

16
00:01:14.197 --> 00:01:17.541
But the food got cold.

17
00:01:17.542 --> 00:01:21.039
Beauty stared out the window.

18
00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:24.713
Father wasn't home yet.

19
00:01:24.714 --> 00:01:27.770
But the deer stood there.

20
00:01:27.771 --> 00:01:31.947
"What did you bring me today?" Beauty called.

21
00:01:31.948 --> 00:01:37.930
The deer had something red in her mouth.

22
00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:44.255
Beauty hurried outside.

23
00:01:44.256 --> 00:01:48.806
The deer was holding a piece of fine red cloth.

24
00:01:48.807 --> 00:01:52.465
She dropped it at Beauty's feet.

25
00:01:52.466 --> 00:01:57.046
Slowly Beauty picked it up.

26
00:01:57.047 --> 00:02:00.933
The red cloth was muddy and torn.

27
00:02:00.934 --> 00:02:05.020
Beauty stared at it, her heart beating faster.

28
00:02:05.021 --> 00:02:08.305
"Deer, why did you bring me this?"

29
00:02:08.306 --> 00:02:11.782
Deer nodded toward the forest.

30
00:02:11.783 --> 00:02:15.094
"I don't understand," Beauty said.

31
00:02:15.095 --> 00:02:17.915
Beauty rubbed dirt off the cloth.

32
00:02:17.916 --> 00:02:20.187
A chill ran up her spine.

33
00:02:20.188 --> 00:02:23.903
Now she understood!

34
00:02:23.904 --> 00:02:29.625
"This is like the cloth Father sells!" she said.

35
00:02:29.626 --> 00:02:32.390
Her heart sank.

36
00:02:32.391 --> 00:02:35.875
"Deer, where did you find this?"

37
00:02:35.876 --> 00:02:39.227
Deer pointed toward the forest again.

38
00:02:39.228 --> 00:02:42.869
Beauty gulped.

39
00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:50.738
"I promised to stay out of there," she thought.

40
00:02:50.739 --> 00:02:53.663
"But what if Father is hurt?"

41
00:02:53.664 --> 00:02:56.385
Beauty quickly made up her mind.

42
00:02:56.386 --> 00:03:02.197
"Deer, please show me where you found this!"

43
00:03:02.198 --> 00:03:07.632
Together they entered the forest.

